    "html": "<p>A projectile of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is fired with initial speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> at an angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\beta\"></span> to the vertical. Air resistance is negligible.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the momentum of the projectile at point D? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mvsin\\beta\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mvcos\\beta\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">zero</li>\n</ol>"
